; BULWARK's window (design ruling 4): the Pier carries this from NEW_ROUND POST until ITS OWN turn
; starts. until = START_OF_TURN (3) is cleared on the HOLDER at its turn start (unit_condition.gd:23),
; and the holder is the Pier. NO `to`: it exists to be READ, by passive_bulwark_cover_aura's
; requires_buff (passive_aura.gd:40). Applying or clearing it re-runs every aura, because its source
; gear (mt_bulwark) holds a PassiveAura (unit_condition.gd:765-768, :987-989) - so the cover switches
; on at round start and off at the Pier's turn start in the same event. Hidden: the cover chip on the
; sheltered allies is the on-map sign.
[resource]
script = ExtResource("1_buff")
until = 3
hide_from_player = true
